msgid "BBCode in RichTextLabel"
msgstr "RichTextLabel 中的 BBCode"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "前言"

msgid ""
":ref:`class_Label` nodes are great for displaying basic text, but they have "
"limitations. If you want to change the color of the text, or its alignment, "
"you can only do that to the entire label. You can't make a part of the text "
"have another color, or have a part of the text centered. To get around these "
"limitations, you would use a :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`class_Label` 節點非常適合顯示基本文字，但有其限制。若你想改變文字顏色或"
"對齊方式，只能套用在整個標籤上，不能只改變部分文字顏色，也不能只讓部分文字置"
"中。為了突破這些限制，你可以使用 :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`。"

msgid ""
":ref:`class_RichTextLabel` allows for complex formatting of text using a "
"markup syntax or the built-in API. It uses BBCodes for the markup syntax, a "
"system of tags that designate formatting rules for a part of the text. You "
"may be familiar with them if you ever used forums (also known as *bulletin "
"boards*, hence the \"BB\" in \"BBCode\")."
msgstr ""
":ref:`class_RichTextLabel` 支援通過標記語法或內建 API 對文字進行複雜格式化。"
"它採用 BBCodes 作為標記語法——這是一套用於為文字片段指定格式化規則的標籤系統。"
"如果您曾使用過論壇（也稱為 *bulletin boards* ，因此“BBCode”中的“BB”即源於"
"此），那麼您可能對這些標籤並不陌生。"

msgid ""
"Unlike Label, RichTextLabel also comes with its own vertical scrollbar. This "
"scrollbar is automatically displayed if the text does not fit within the "
"control's size. The scrollbar can be disabled by unchecking the **Scroll "
"Active** property in the RichTextLabel inspector."
msgstr ""
"與 Label 不同，RichTextLabel 內建自己的垂直捲軸。當文字超出控制元件大小時，捲"
"軸會自動顯示。你也可以在 RichTextLabel 的屬性面板中取消勾選 **Scroll "
"Active** 屬性來關閉捲軸。"

msgid ""
"Note that the BBCode tags can also be used to some extent for other use "
"cases:"
msgstr "注意，BBCode 標籤在其他情境下也可部分使用："

msgid ""
"BBCode can be used to :ref:`format comments in the XML source of the class "
"reference <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 可用於 :ref:`格式化類別參考文件 XML 原始碼中的註解 "
"<doc_class_reference_bbcode>`。"

msgid ""
"BBCode can be used in :ref:`GDScript documentation comments "
"<doc_gdscript_documentation_comments_bbcode_and_class_reference>`."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 也可以用在 :ref:`GDScript 的說明註解 "
"<doc_gdscript_documentation_comments_bbcode_and_class_reference>`。"

msgid ""
"BBCode can be used when :ref:`printing rich text to the Output bottom panel "
"<doc_output_panel_printing_rich_text>`."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 可用於 :ref:`將富文字輸出到下方的「輸出」面板 "
"<doc_output_panel_printing_rich_text>`。"

msgid ""
"You can see how BBCode in RichTextLabel works in action using the `Rich Text "
"Label with BBCode demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode>`__."
msgstr ""
"你可以透過 `Rich Text Label with BBCode 範例專案 <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode>`__，實際體"
"驗 RichTextLabel 的 BBCode 功能。"

msgid "Using BBCode"
msgstr "使用 BBCode"

msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` functions like a "
"normal :ref:`class_Label`. It has the :ref:`text "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` property, which you can edit to have "
"uniformly formatted text. To be able to use BBCode for rich text formatting, "
"you need to turn on the BBCode mode by setting :ref:`bbcode_enabled "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_bbcode_enabled>`. After that, you can edit "
"the :ref:`text <class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` property using available "
"tags. Both properties are located at the top of the inspector after "
"selecting a RichTextLabel node."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，:ref:`class_RichTextLabel` 的功能和一個普通的 :ref:`class_Label` "
"一樣。它擁有一個 :ref:`text <class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` 屬性，你可以"
"編輯它來顯示統一格式的文字。如果想要使用 BBCode 來實現富文字排版，你需要通過"
"設定 :ref:`bbcode_enabled <class_RichTextLabel_property_bbcode_enabled>` 來開"
"啟 BBCode 模式。開啟之後，你就可以在 :ref:`text "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` 屬性中使用各種可用的標籤了。選中 "
"RichTextLabel 節點後，這兩個屬性都位於屬性檢視器（Inspector）的最上方。"

msgid ""
"For example, :bbcode:`BBCode [color=green]test[/color]` would render the "
"word \"test\" with a green color."
msgstr ""
"例如，:bbcode:`BBCode [color=green]test[/color]` 會以綠色顯示「test」一詞。"

msgid ""
"Most BBCodes consist of 3 parts: the opening tag, the content and the "
"closing tag. The opening tag delimits the start of the formatted part, and "
"can also carry some configuration options. Some opening tags, like the "
"``color`` one shown above, also require a value to work. Other opening tags "
"may accept multiple options (separated by spaces within the opening tag). "
"The closing tag delimits the end of the formatted part. In some cases, both "
"the closing tag and the content can be omitted."
msgstr ""
"大多數 BBCode 標籤由三個部分組成：起始標籤、內容與結束標籤。起始標籤標記格式"
"化區段的開始，也可帶一些設定選項。有些標籤（像上例的 ``color``）需要指定值，"
"其他起始標籤也可能接受多個選項（用空格分隔）。結束標籤標記格式化區段的結尾。"
"有時候內容或結束標籤可以省略。"

msgid ""
"Unlike BBCode in HTML, leading/trailing whitespace is not removed by a "
"RichTextLabel upon display. Duplicate spaces are also displayed as-is in the "
"final output. This means that when displaying a code block in a "
"RichTextLabel, you don't need to use a preformatted text tag."
msgstr ""
"與 HTML 的 BBCode 實作不同，RichTextLabel 在顯示時不會移除前置或尾端空白。重"
"複空白也會原樣顯示在畫面上。因此，在 RichTextLabel 顯示程式碼區塊時，無需特別"
"預先格式化標記。"

msgid ""
"RichTextLabel doesn't support entangled BBCode tags. For example, instead of "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"RichTextLabel 不支援交錯（嵌套錯誤）的 BBCode 標籤。舉例來說，不要寫成："

msgid "Use:"
msgstr "請改用："

msgid "Handling user input safely"
msgstr "安全處理使用者輸入"

msgid ""
"In a scenario where users may freely input text (such as chat in a "
"multiplayer game), you should make sure users cannot use arbitrary BBCode "
"tags that will be parsed by RichTextLabel. This is to avoid inappropriate "
"use of formatting, which can be problematic if:bbcode:`[url]` tags are "
"handled by your RichTextLabel (as players may be able to create clickable "
"links to phishing sites or similar)."
msgstr ""
"在使用者可自由輸入文字的情境下（例如多人遊戲聊天），應確保使用者不能任意輸入"
"會被 RichTextLabel 解析的 BBCode 標籤，避免濫用格式功能。尤其當 "
"RichTextLabel 會處理 :bbcode:`[url]` 標籤時，玩家可能藉此建立指向釣魚網站等位"
"置的可點選連結。"

msgid ""
"Using RichTextLabel's :bbcode:`[lb]` and/or :bbcode:`[rb]` tags, we can "
"replace the opening and/or closing brackets of any BBCode tag in a message "
"with those escaped tags. This prevents users from using BBCode that will be "
"parsed as tags – instead, the BBCode will be displayed as text."
msgstr ""
"使用 RichTextLabel 的 :bbcode:`[lb]` 和／或 :bbcode:`[rb]` 標籤，可以將訊息中"
"任何 BBCode 標籤的左、右中括號替換成跳脫標籤，避免使用者輸入的 BBCode 被當成"
"標籤解析，而是以文字顯示。"

msgid ""
"Example of unescaped user input resulting in BBCode injection (2nd line) and "
"escaped user input (3rd line)"
msgstr ""
"未經轉義的使用者輸入會造成 BBCode 注入（第二行），而經過轉義的輸入（第三行）"
"就能避開這個問題"

msgid "The above image was created using the following script:"
msgstr "以上範例圖是用下列腳本產生："

msgid "Stripping BBCode tags"
msgstr "移除 BBCode 標籤"

msgid ""
"For certain use cases, it can be desired to remove BBCode tags from the "
"string. This is useful when displaying the RichTextLabel's text in another "
"Control that does not support BBCode (such as a tooltip):"
msgstr ""
"有些情境下，可能需要將字串中的 BBCode 標籤移除。例如當你想把 RichTextLabel 的"
"文字顯示在另一個不支援 BBCode 的控制元件（如工具提示）時。"

msgid ""
"Removing BBCode tags entirely isn't advised for user input, as it can modify "
"the displayed text without users understanding why part of their message was "
"removed. :ref:`Escaping user input "
"<doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_user_input_safely>` should be "
"preferred instead."
msgstr ""
"對於玩家輸入，不建議直接移除 BBCode 標籤，因為這會讓部份訊息消失而玩家不明白"
"原因。建議優先採用 :ref:`轉義使用者輸入 "
"<doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_user_input_safely>`。"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "效能"

msgid ""
"In most cases, you can use BBCode directly as-is since text formatting is "
"rarely a heavy task. However, with particularly large RichTextLabels (such "
"as console logs spanning thousands of lines), you may encounter stuttering "
"during gameplay when the RichTextLabel's text is updated."
msgstr ""
"大多數情況下，直接用 BBCode 格式化文字不會有太大負擔。但如果 RichTextLabel 內"
"容非常龐大（例如含有上千行的主控台日誌），更新文字時可能會造成遊戲卡頓。"

msgid "There are several ways to alleviate this:"
msgstr "你可以採取以下方法改善："

msgid ""
"Use the ``append_text()`` function instead of appending to the ``text`` "
"property. This function will only parse BBCode for the added text, rather "
"than parsing BBCode from the entire ``text`` property."
msgstr ""
"改用 ``append_text()`` 方法，而不是直接加在 ``text`` 屬性後面。這樣只會解析新"
"加上的 BBCode，而不會重新解析整段文字。"

msgid ""
"Use ``push_[tag]()`` and ``pop()`` functions to add tags to RichTextLabel "
"instead of using BBCode."
msgstr ""
"也可以直接用 ``push_[標籤]()`` 和 ``pop()`` 方法加上格式標籤，而不用寫 "
"BBCode。"

msgid ""
"Enable the **Threading > Threaded** property in RichTextLabel. This won't "
"speed up processing, but it will prevent the main thread from blocking, "
"which avoids stuttering during gameplay. Only enable threading if it's "
"actually needed in your project, as threading has some overhead."
msgstr ""
"啟用 RichTextLabel 的 **Threading > Threaded** 屬性。這雖然不會加快處理速度，"
"但能避免主執行緒被卡住，也就不會影響遊戲流暢度。只有實際需要才建議啟用，因為"
"多執行緒有額外開銷。"

msgid "Using push_[tag]() and pop() functions instead of BBCode"
msgstr "以 push_[標籤]() 和 pop() 方法取代 BBCode"

msgid ""
"If you don't want to use BBCode for performance reasons, you can use "
"functions provided by RichTextLabel to create formatting tags without "
"writing BBCode in the text."
msgstr ""
"如果因為效能考量不想用 BBCode，也可以使用 RichTextLabel 提供的函式來直接加上"
"格式標籤。"

msgid ""
"Every BBCode tag (including effects) has a ``push_[tag]()`` function (where "
"``[tag]`` is the tag's name). There are also a few convenience functions "
"available, such as ``push_bold_italics()`` that combines both "
"``push_bold()`` and ``push_italics()`` into a single tag. See "
"the :ref:`RichTextLabel class reference <class_RichTextLabel>` for a "
"complete list of ``push_[tag]()`` functions."
msgstr ""
"每個 BBCode 標籤（包含特效）都有對應的 ``push_[標籤]()`` 方法（[標籤] 是名"
"稱）。有些還有方便的組合方法，例如 ``push_bold_italics()`` 就是同時加上粗體與"
"斜體。完整清單請參見 :ref:`RichTextLabel 類別參考 <class_RichTextLabel>`。"

msgid ""
"The ``pop()`` function is used to end *any* tag. Since BBCode is a tag "
"*stack*, using ``pop()`` will close the most recently started tags first."
msgstr ""
"``pop()`` 用來結束任何標籤。BBCode 標籤是堆疊式的，因此 pop() 會優先結束最近 "
"push 的標籤。"

msgid ""
"The following script will result in the same visual output as "
"using :bbcode:`BBCode [color=green]test [i]example[/i][/color]`:"
msgstr ""
"下列腳本的視覺輸出與使用 :bbcode:`BBCode [color=green]test [i]example[/i][/"
"color]` 相同："

msgid ""
"Do **not** set the ``text`` property directly when using formatting "
"functions. Appending to the ``text`` property will erase all modifications "
"made to the RichTextLabel using the ``append_text()``, ``push_[tag]()`` and "
"``pop()`` functions."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 若你已使用格式化方法，請勿再直接設 ``text`` 屬性，否則會清除先前"
"用 ``append_text()`` 、 ``push_[標籤]()`` 、 ``pop()`` 加上的格式。"

msgid "Reference"
msgstr "參考"

msgid ""
"*Some* of these BBCode tags can be used in tooltips for ``@export`` script "
"variables as well as in the XML source of the class reference. For more "
"information, see :ref:`Class reference BBCode <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."
msgstr ""
"部份 BBCode 標籤也可用於 ``@export`` 腳本變數的工具提示，以及類別參考文件的 "
"XML 原始碼。有關詳情，請見 :ref:`類別參考 BBCode "
"<doc_class_reference_bbcode>`。"

msgid "Tag"
msgstr "標籤"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "範例"

msgid "**b**"
msgstr "**b**"

msgid ""
"Makes ``{text}`` use the bold (or bold italics) font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 以 ``RichTextLabel`` 的粗體（或粗斜體）字型顯示。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[b]{text}[/b]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[b]{text}[/b]`"

msgid "**i**"
msgstr "**i**"

msgid ""
"Makes ``{text}`` use the italics (or bold italics) font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 以 ``RichTextLabel`` 的斜體（或粗斜體）字型顯示。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[i]{text}[/i]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[i]{text}[/i]`"

msgid "**u**"
msgstr "**u**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` underlined."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 顯示底線。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[u]{text}[/u]` :bbcode:`[u color={color}]{text}[/u]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[u]{text}[/u]` :bbcode:`[u color={color}]{text}[/u]`"

msgid "**s**"
msgstr "**s**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` strikethrough."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 顯示刪除線。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[s]{text}[/s]` :bbcode:`[s color={color}]{text}[/s]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[s]{text}[/s]` :bbcode:`[s color={color}]{text}[/s]`"

msgid "**code**"
msgstr "**code**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` use the mono font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 使用 ``RichTextLabel`` 的等寬字型。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[code]{text}[/code]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[code]{text}[/code]`"

msgid "**char**"
msgstr "**char**"

msgid "Adds Unicode character with hexadecimal UTF-32 ``{codepoint}``."
msgstr "插入具有十六進位 UTF-32 ``{codepoint}`` 的 Unicode 字元。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[char={codepoint}]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[char={codepoint}]`"

msgid "**p**"
msgstr "**p**"

msgid ""
"Adds new paragraph with ``{text}``. Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_paragraph_options`."
msgstr ""
"新增一個帶有 ``{text}`` 的新段落。支援設定選項，詳"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_paragraph_options`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[p]{text}[/p]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[p]{text}[/p]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[p {options}]{text}[/p]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[p {options}]{text}[/p]`"

msgid "**br**"
msgstr "**br**"

msgid ""
"Adds line break in a text, without adding a new paragraph. If used within a "
"list, this won't create a new list item, but will add a line break within "
"the current item instead."
msgstr ""
"在文字中加入換行，而不新增新段落。若用於清單中，不會建立新的清單項目，而是在"
"目前項目內換行。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[br]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[br]`"

msgid "**hr**"
msgstr "**hr**"

msgid ""
"Adds new a horizontal rule to separate content. Supports configuration "
"options, see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hr_options`."
msgstr ""
"新增一條水平分隔線以區隔內容。支援設定選項，"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hr_options`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[hr]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[hr]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[hr {options}]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[hr {options}]`"

msgid "**center**"
msgstr "**center**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally centered."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 水平置中。"

msgid "Same as :bbcode:`[p align=center]`."
msgstr "等同於 :bbcode:`[p align=center]`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[center]{text}[/center]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[center]{text}[/center]`"

msgid "**left**"
msgstr "**left**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally left-aligned."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 水平靠左對齊。"

msgid "Same as :bbcode:`[p align=left]`."
msgstr "等同於 :bbcode:`[p align=left]`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[left]{text}[/left]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[left]{text}[/left]`"

msgid "**right**"
msgstr "**right**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally right-aligned."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 水平靠右對齊。"

msgid "Same as :bbcode:`[p align=right]`."
msgstr "等同於 :bbcode:`[p align=right]`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[right]{text}[/right]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[right]{text}[/right]`"

msgid "**fill**"
msgstr "**fill**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` fill the full width of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 填滿整個 ``RichTextLabel`` 的寬度。"

msgid "Same as :bbcode:`[p align=fill]`."
msgstr "等同於 :bbcode:`[p align=fill]`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[fill]{text}[/fill]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[fill]{text}[/fill]`"

msgid "**indent**"
msgstr "**indent**"

msgid ""
"Indents ``{text}`` once. The indentation width is the same as "
"with :bbcode:`[ul]` or :bbcode:`[ol]`, but without a bullet point."
msgstr ""
"將 ``{text}`` 縮排一層。縮排寬度與 :bbcode:`[ul]` 或 :bbcode:`[ol]` 相同，但"
"不顯示項目符號。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[indent]{text}[/indent]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[indent]{text}[/indent]`"

msgid "**url**"
msgstr "**url**"

msgid ""
"Creates a hyperlink (underlined and clickable text). Can contain optional "
"``{text}`` or display ``{link}`` as is. Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_url_options`."
msgstr ""
"建立一個超連結（帶底線且可點擊的文字）。可以包含可選的 ``{text}`` 作為顯示文"
"字，或者直接原樣顯示 ``{link}`` 。支援設定選項，詳情請"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_url_options` 。"

msgid ""
"**Must be handled with the \"meta_clicked\" signal to have an effect,** "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_url_tag_clicks`."
msgstr ""
"**必須在「meta_clicked」訊號中處理才會有作用，** 詳"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_url_tag_clicks` 。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[url]{link}[/url]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[url]{link}[/url]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[url={link}]{text}[/url]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[url={link}]{text}[/url]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[url {options}]{text}[/url]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[url {options}]{text}[/url]`"

msgid "**hint**"
msgstr "**霧：**"

msgid ""
"Creates a tooltip hint that is displayed when hovering the text with the "
"mouse. While not required, it's recommended to put tooltip text between "
"double or single quotes. Note that it is not possible to escape quotes using "
"``\\\"`` or ``\\'``. To use single quotes for apostrophes in the hint "
"string, you must use double quotes to surround the string."
msgstr ""
"建立滑鼠游標懸停文字時顯示的工具提示。雖非必須，但建議以雙引號或單引號包住提"
"示文字。注意無法使用 ``\\\"`` 或 ``\\'`` 來逸出引號。若提示字串中需要使用單引"
"號作為撇號，則必須以雙引號包住整個字串。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[hint=\"{tooltip text displayed on hover}\"]{text}[/hint]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[hint=\"{tooltip text displayed on hover}\"]{text}[/hint]`"

msgid "**img**"
msgstr "**img**"

msgid ""
"Inserts an image from the ``{path}`` (can be any "
"valid :ref:`class_Texture2D` resource)."
msgstr "由 ``{path}`` 插入圖片（可為任意有效的 :ref:`class_Texture2D` 資源）。"

msgid ""
"If ``{width}`` is provided, the image will try to fit that width maintaining "
"the aspect ratio."
msgstr "若指定 ``{width}``，圖片會嘗試符合該寬度並維持比例。"

msgid ""
"If both ``{width}`` and ``{height}`` are provided, the image will be scaled "
"to that size."
msgstr "若同時指定 ``{width}`` 與 ``{height}``，圖片會縮放到該尺寸。"

msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of ``{width}`` or ``{height}`` value to specify it as "
"percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{width}`` 或 ``{height}`` 後加 ``%``，即可將其指定為控制元件寬度的百分"
"比，而非像素。"

msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of ``{width}`` or ``{height}`` value to specify it as "
"a ratio of the current font size. For example, ``height=1em`` will make the "
"image as tall as the surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{width}`` 或 ``{height}`` 的數值末尾新增 ``em``，可將其指定為目前字型大"
"小的倍數。例如，``height=1em`` 會使影像的高度與周圍文字的高度相同。"

msgid ""
"If ``{valign}`` configuration is provided, the image will try to align to "
"the surrounding text, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."
msgstr ""
"若提供 ``{valign}`` 設定，圖片會嘗試與周圍文字對齊，詳"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`。"

msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_options`."
msgstr ""
"支援更多設定選項，詳見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_options`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[img]{path}[/img]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[img]{path}[/img]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[img={width}]{path}[/img]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[img={width}]{path}[/img]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[img={width}x{height}]{path}[/img]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[img={width}x{height}]{path}[/img]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[img={valign}]{path}[/img]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[img={valign}]{path}[/img]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[img {options}]{path}[/img]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[img {options}]{path}[/img]`"

msgid "**font**"
msgstr "**font**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` use a font resource from the ``{path}``."
msgstr "讓 ``{text}`` 使用來自 ``{path}`` 的字型資源。"

msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_font_options`."
msgstr ""
"支援更多設定選項，詳見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_font_options`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[font={path}]{text}[/font]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[font={path}]{text}[/font]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[font {options}]{text}[/font]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[font {options}]{text}[/font]`"

msgid "**font_size**"
msgstr "**font_size**"

msgid "Use custom font size for ``{text}``."
msgstr "設定 ``{text}`` 的自訂字型大小。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[font_size={size}]{text}[/font_size]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[font_size={size}]{text}[/font_size]`"

msgid "**dropcap**"
msgstr "**dropcap**"

msgid ""
"Use a different font size and color for ``{text}``, while making the tag's "
"contents span multiple lines if it's large enough."
msgstr "設定 ``{text}`` 為不同字型大小與顏色，若內容夠大時可跨多行顯示。"

msgid ""
"A `drop cap <https://www.computerhope.com/jargon/d/dropcap.htm>`__ is "
"typically one uppercase character, but :bbcode:`[dropcap]` supports "
"containing multiple characters. ``margins`` values are comma-separated and "
"can be positive, zero or negative. Values must **not** be separated by "
"spaces; otherwise, the values won't be parsed correctly. Negative top and "
"bottom margins are particularly useful to allow the rest of the paragraph to "
"display below the dropcap."
msgstr ""
"`首字下沉 <https://www.computerhope.com/jargon/d/dropcap.htm>`__ 通常是一個大"
"寫字母，但 :bbcode:`[dropcap]` 也支援包含多個字元。``margins`` 的值以逗號分"
"隔，可以是正數、零或負數。各值之間 **不得** 以空白分隔，否則無法正確解析。負"
"的上、下邊界特別適合讓段落的其餘內容顯示在首字下沉的下方。"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[dropcap font={font} font_size={size} color={color} "
"outline_size={size} outline_color={color} margins={left},{top},{right},"
"{bottom}]{text}[/dropcap]`"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[dropcap font={font} font_size={size} color={color} "
"outline_size={size} outline_color={color} margins={left},{top},{right},"
"{bottom}]{text}[/dropcap]`"

msgid "**opentype_features**"
msgstr "**功能：**"

msgid ""
"Enables custom OpenType font features for ``{text}``. Features must be "
"provided as a comma-separated ``{list}``. Values must **not** be separated "
"by spaces; otherwise, the list won't be parsed correctly."
msgstr ""
"為 ``{text}`` 啟用自訂 OpenType 字型功能。功能必須以逗號分隔的 ``{list}`` 指"
"定。各值之間 **不得** 以空白分隔；否則清單將無法正確解析。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[opentype_features={list}]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[opentype_features={list}]`"

msgid "``{text}``"
msgstr "``{text}``"

msgid ":bbcode:`[/opentype_features]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[/opentype_features]`"

msgid "**lang**"
msgstr "**lang**"

msgid ""
"Overrides the language for ``{text}`` that is set by the **BiDi > Language** "
"property in :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`. ``{code}`` must be an "
"ISO :ref:`language code <doc_locales>`. This can be used to enforce the use "
"of a specific script for a language without starting a new paragraph. Some "
"font files may contain script-specific substitutes, in which case they will "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"覆寫 :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` 中 **BiDi > Language** 屬性對 ``{text}`` 設定"
"的語言。 ``{code}`` 必須為 ISO :ref:`語言代碼 <doc_locales>`。這可用來強制某"
"段文字使用特定語系腳本，而不需另起段落。有些字型檔可能包含特定語系的替代字"
"形，若有則會自動套用。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[lang={code}]{text}[/lang]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[lang={code}]{text}[/lang]`"

msgid "**color**"
msgstr "**color**"

msgid ""
"Changes the color of ``{text}``. Color must be provided by a common name "
"(see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_named_colors`) or using the HEX "
"format (e.g. ``#ff00ff``, see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hex_colors`)."
msgstr ""
"改變 ``{text}`` 的顏色。顏色可用一般名稱"
"（見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_named_colors`）或 HEX 格式（如 "
"``#ff00ff``，見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hex_colors`）。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[color={code/name}]{text}[/color]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[color={code/name}]{text}[/color]`"

msgid "**bgcolor**"
msgstr "**編輯器:**"

msgid ""
"Draws the color behind ``{text}``. This can be used to highlight text. "
"Accepts same values as the ``color`` tag. By default, there is a slight "
"padding which is controlled by the ``text_highlight_h_padding`` and "
"``text_highlight_v_padding`` theme items in the RichTextLabel node. Set "
"padding to ``0`` to avoid potential overlapping issues when there are "
"background colors on neighboring lines/columns."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{text}`` 背後繪製顏色，可用於強調文字。接受與 ``color`` 標籤相同的值。預"
"設會加入些許內距，內距由 RichTextLabel 節點中的 ``text_highlight_h_padding`` "
"與 ``text_highlight_v_padding`` 主題項目控制。若相鄰的行/欄也有背景色，為避免"
"可能的重疊問題，請將內距設為 ``0``。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[bgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/bgcolor]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[bgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/bgcolor]`"

msgid "**fgcolor**"
msgstr "**編輯器:**"

msgid ""
"Draws the color in front of ``{text}``. This can be used to \"redact\" text "
"by using an opaque foreground color. Accepts same values as the ``color`` "
"tag. By default, there is a slight padding which is controlled by the "
"``text_highlight_h_padding`` and ``text_highlight_v_padding`` theme items in "
"the RichTextLabel node. Set padding to ``0`` to avoid potential overlapping "
"issues when there are foreground colors on neighboring lines/columns."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{text}`` 前方繪製顏色，可使用不透明的前景色來「遮蔽」文字。接受與 "
"``color`` 標籤相同的值。預設會加入些許內距，內距由 RichTextLabel 節點中的 "
"``text_highlight_h_padding`` 與 ``text_highlight_v_padding`` 主題項目控制。若"
"相鄰的行/欄也有前景色，為避免可能的重疊問題，請將內距設為 ``0``。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[fgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/fgcolor]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[fgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/fgcolor]`"

msgid "**outline_size**"
msgstr "**outline_size**"

msgid "Use custom font outline size for ``{text}``."
msgstr "設定 ``{text}`` 的字型外框寬度。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[outline_size={size}]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[outline_size={size}]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`{text}`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`{text}`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[/outline_size]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[/outline_size]`"

msgid "**outline_color**"
msgstr "**編輯器:**"

msgid ""
"Use custom outline color for ``{text}``. Accepts same values as the "
"``color`` tag."
msgstr "設定 ``{text}`` 的字型外框顏色。接受與 ``color`` 標籤相同的值。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[outline_color={code/name}]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[outline_color={code/name}]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[/outline_color]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[/outline_color]`"

msgid "**table**"
msgstr "**table**"

msgid ""
"Creates a table with the ``{number}`` of columns. Use the ``cell`` tag to "
"define table cells."
msgstr "建立一個含 ``{number}`` 欄的表格，使用 ``cell`` 標籤定義儲存格。"

msgid ""
"If ``{valign}`` configuration is provided, the table will try to align to "
"the surrounding text, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."
msgstr ""
"若指定 ``{valign}``，表格會嘗試與周圍文字對齊，詳"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`。"

msgid ""
"If baseline alignment is used, the table is aligned to the baseline of the "
"row with index ``{alignment_row}`` (zero-based)."
msgstr ""
"若使用 baseline 對齊，表格會對齊到第 ``{alignment_row}`` 行的基線（由 0 起"
"算）。"

msgid "``{name}`` is a table name for assistive apps (screen reader)."
msgstr "``{name}`` 是供輔助應用（螢幕閱讀器）使用的表格名稱。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[table={number}]{cells}[/table]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[table={number}]{cells}[/table]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[table={number},{valign}]{cells}[/table]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[table={number},{valign}]{cells}[/table]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row}]{cells}[/table]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row}]{cells}[/table]`"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row} name={name}]{cells}[/"
"table]`"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row} name={name}]{cells}[/"
"table]`"

msgid "**cell**"
msgstr "**cell**"

msgid "Adds a cell with ``{text}`` to the table."
msgstr "新增一格帶有 ``{text}`` 的儲存格。"

msgid ""
"If ``{ratio}`` is provided, the cell will try to expand to that value "
"proportionally to other cells and their ratio values."
msgstr "若有設定 ``{ratio}``，儲存格會依比例自動調整寬度。"

msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_cell_options`."
msgstr ""
"支援其他設定選項，詳見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_cell_options`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[cell]{text}[/cell]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[cell]{text}[/cell]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[cell={ratio}]{text}[/cell]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[cell={ratio}]{text}[/cell]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[cell {options}]{text}[/cell]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[cell {options}]{text}[/cell]`"

msgid "**ul**"
msgstr "**ul**"

msgid ""
"Adds an unordered list. List ``{items}`` must be provided by putting one "
"item per line of text."
msgstr "新增一個無序列表，``{items}`` 每行一個條目。"

msgid ""
"The bullet point can be customized using the ``{bullet}`` parameter, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_unordered_list_bullet`."
msgstr ""
"可用 ``{bullet}`` 參數自訂符號，詳"
"見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_unordered_list_bullet`。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[ul]{items}[/ul]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[ul]{items}[/ul]`"

msgid ":bbcode:`[ul bullet={bullet}]{items}[/ul]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[ul bullet={bullet}]{items}[/ul]`"

msgid "**ol**"
msgstr "**ol**"

msgid ""
"Adds an ordered (numbered) list of the given ``{type}`` "
"(see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_list_types`). List ``{items}`` must "
"be provided by putting one item per line of text."
msgstr ""
"新增一個指定 ``{type}`` 類型的有序（編號）清單（請參"
"閱 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_list_types`）。必須提供 ``{items}`` 清"
"單，方法是在文字中每一行放入一個項目。"

msgid ":bbcode:`[ol type={type}]{items}[/ol]`"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[ol type={type}]{items}[/ol]`"

msgid "**lb**, **rb**"
msgstr "**磅**，**rb**"

msgid "Adds ``[`` and ``]`` respectively. Allows escaping BBCode markup."
msgstr "分別插入 ``[`` 與 ``]``，可用於 BBCode 轉義。"

msgid ""
"These are self-closing tags, which means you do not need to close them (and "
"there is no ``[/lb]`` or ``[/rb]`` closing tag)."
msgstr "這些是自結束標籤，不需要結束標籤（沒有 ``[/lb]`` 或 ``[/rb]``）。"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[lb]b[rb]text[lb]/b[rb]` will display as :bbcode:`[b]text[/b]`."
msgstr ":bbcode:`[lb]b[rb]text[lb]/b[rb]` 會顯示為 :bbcode:`[b]text[/b]`。"

msgid ""
"Several Unicode control characters can be added using their own self-closing "
"tags."
msgstr "可以使用自己的自結束標記來新增多個 Unicode 控製字元。"

msgid "This can result in easier maintenance compared to pasting those"
msgstr "與貼上這些相比，這可以使維護更容易"

msgid "control characters directly in the text."
msgstr "直接在文字中控製字元。"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[lrm]` (left-to-right mark), :bbcode:`[rlm]` (right-to-left "
"mark), :bbcode:`[lre]` (left-to-right embedding),"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[lrm]`（從左到右標記）、:bbcode:`[rlm]`（從右到左標"
"記）、:bbcode:`[lre]`（從左到右嵌入）、"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[rle]` (right-to-left embedding), :bbcode:`[lro]` (left-to-right "
"override), :bbcode:`[rlo]` (right-to-left override),"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[rle]`（從右到左嵌入）、:bbcode:`[lro]`（從左到右覆"
"寫）、:bbcode:`[rlo]`（從右到左覆寫）、"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[pdf]` (pop directional formatting), :bbcode:`[alm]` (Arabic letter "
"mark), :bbcode:`[lri]` (left-to-right isolate),"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[pdf]`（結束方向格式）、:bbcode:`[alm]`（阿拉伯字母標"
"記）、:bbcode:`[lri]`（從左到右隔離）、"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[rli]` (right-to-left isolate), :bbcode:`[fsi]` (first strong "
"isolate), :bbcode:`[pdi]` (pop directional isolate),"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[rli]`（從右到左隔離）、:bbcode:`[fsi]`（依第一個強方向字元隔"
"離）、:bbcode:`[pdi]`（結束方向隔離）、"

msgid ""
":bbcode:`[zwj]` (zero-width joiner), :bbcode:`[zwnj]` (zero-width non-"
"joiner), :bbcode:`[wj]` (word joiner),"
msgstr ""
":bbcode:`[zwj]`（零寬度連接字元）、:bbcode:`[zwnj]`（零寬度不連接字"
"元）、:bbcode:`[wj]`（單字連接字元）、"

msgid ":bbcode:`[shy]` (soft hyphen)"
msgstr ":bbcode:`[shy]`（軟連字號）"

msgid ""
"Tags for bold (:bbcode:`[b]`) and italics (:bbcode:`[i]`) formatting work "
"best if the appropriate custom fonts are set up in the RichTextLabelNode's "
"theme overrides. If no custom bold or italic fonts are defined, `faux bold "
"and italic fonts <https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/"
"faux_fake_pseudo_synthesized>`__ will be generated by Godot. These fonts "
"rarely look good in comparison to hand-made bold/italic font variants."
msgstr ""
"若在 RichTextLabel 節點的主題覆寫中設定適當的自訂字型，粗體（:bbcode:`[b]`）"
"和斜體（:bbcode:`[i]`）標籤會有最佳效果。如果沒有定義自訂的粗體或斜體字型，"
"Godot 就會產生 `模擬粗體和斜體字型 <https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/"
"glossary/faux_fake_pseudo_synthesized>`__。這類字型通常不如專門設計的粗體與斜"
"體字型美觀。"

msgid ""
"The monospaced (:bbcode:`[code]`) tag **only** works if a custom font is set "
"up in the RichTextLabel node's theme overrides. Otherwise, monospaced text "
"will use the regular font."
msgstr ""
"等寬字型標籤（:bbcode:`[code]`）**只有** 在 RichTextLabel 節點的主題覆寫中設"
"定自訂字型時才會生效，否則等寬文字仍會使用一般字型。"

msgid "There are no BBCode tags to control vertical centering of text yet."
msgstr "目前還沒有用於控制文字垂直居中的BBCode標籤."

msgid "Options can be skipped for all tags."
msgstr "可以跳過所有標籤的選項。"

msgid "Paragraph options"
msgstr "段落選項"

msgid "**align**"
msgstr "**align**"

msgid "**Values**"
msgstr "**值**"

msgid ""
"``left`` (or ``l``), ``center`` (or ``c``), ``right`` (or ``r``), ``fill`` "
"(or ``f``)"
msgstr ""
"``left`` (or ``l``), ``center`` (or ``c``), ``right`` (or ``r``), ``fill`` "
"(or ``f``)"

msgid "**Default**"
msgstr "**預設**"

msgid "``left``"
msgstr "``length()``"

msgid "Text horizontal alignment."
msgstr "文字水平對齊。"

msgid "**bidi_override**, **st**"
msgstr "**bidi_override**、**st**"

msgid ""
"``default`` (of ``d``), ``uri`` (or ``u``), ``file`` (or ``f``), ``email`` "
"(or ``e``), ``list`` (or ``l``), ``none`` (or ``n``), ``custom`` (or ``c``)"
msgstr ""
"``default`` (of ``d``), ``uri`` (or ``u``), ``file`` (or ``f``), ``email`` "
"(or ``e``), ``list`` (or ``l``), ``none`` (or ``n``), ``custom`` (or ``c``)"

msgid "``default``"
msgstr "預設"

msgid "Structured text override."
msgstr "結構化文字覆寫。"

msgid "**justification_flags**, **jst**"
msgstr "**justification_flags**, **jst**"

msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the following values (no space after each comma): "
"``kashida`` (or ``k``), ``word`` (or ``w``), ``trim`` (or ``tr``), "
"``after_last_tab`` (or ``lt``), ``skip_last`` (or ``sl``), "
"``skip_last_with_chars`` (or ``sv``), ``do_not_skip_single`` (or ``ns``)."
msgstr ""
"以下數值以逗號分隔的清單（每個逗號後均無空白）： ``kashida`` （或 ``k``）、 "
"``word`` （或 ``w``）、 ``trim`` （或 ``tr``)， ``after_last_tab`` ( 、 "
"``lt``)， ``skip_last`` ( 、 ``sl``)， ``skip_last_with_chars`` ( 、 "
"``sv``)， ``do_not_skip_single`` ( 或 ``ns`` ）。"

msgid "``word,kashida,skip_last,do_not_skip_single``"
msgstr "``word,kashida,skip_last,do_not_skip_single``"

msgid ""
"Justification (fill alignment) option. See :ref:`class_TextServer` for more "
"details."
msgstr "對齊（填滿）選項。詳見 :ref:`class_TextServer`。"

msgid "**direction**, **dir**"
msgstr "**direction**、**dir**"

msgid "``ltr`` (or ``l``), ``rtl`` (or ``r``), ``auto`` (or ``a``)"
msgstr "``ltr`` (or ``l``), ``rtl`` (or ``r``), ``auto`` (or ``a``)"

msgid "Inherit"
msgstr "繼承"

msgid "Base BiDi direction."
msgstr "基礎雙向文字（BiDi）方向。"

msgid "**language**, **lang**"
msgstr "**language**、**lang**"

msgid "ISO language codes. See :ref:`doc_locales`"
msgstr "ISO 語言代碼，詳見 :ref:`doc_locales`"

msgid ""
"Locale override. Some font files may contain script-specific substitutes, in "
"which case they will be used."
msgstr "地區設定覆寫。有些字型可能包含特定語言腳本的字形，若有則會自動套用。"

msgid "**tab_stops**"
msgstr "**tab_stops**"

msgid "List of floating-point numbers, e.g. ``10.0,30.0``"
msgstr "浮點數列表，例如 ``10.0,30.0``"

msgid "Width of the space character in the font"
msgstr "字型中空白字元的寬度"

msgid ""
"Overrides the horizontal offsets for each tab character. When the end of the "
"list is reached, the tab stops will loop over. For example, if you set "
"``tab_stops`` to ``10.0,30.0``, the first tab will be at ``10`` pixels, the "
"second tab will be at ``10 + 30 = 40`` pixels, and the third tab will be at "
"``10 + 30 + 10 = 50`` pixels from the origin of the RichTextLabel."
msgstr ""
"覆寫每個定位字元（Tab）的水平偏移量。當清單結束時會循環。例如 ``tab_stops`` "
"設為 ``10.0,30.0``，第一個定位點在 10 像素，第二個在 10+30=40 像素，第三個在 "
"10+30+10=50 像素，皆以 RichTextLabel 左上角為原點。"

msgid "Handling :bbcode:`[url]` tag clicks"
msgstr "處理 :bbcode:`[url]` 標籤的點選事件"

msgid ""
"By default, :bbcode:`[url]` tags do nothing when clicked. This is to allow "
"flexible use of :bbcode:`[url]` tags rather than limiting them to opening "
"URLs in a web browser."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，點選 :bbcode:`[url]` 標籤不會有任何動作。這樣能"
"讓 :bbcode:`[url]` 標籤的用途更有彈性，而不是只能在瀏覽器中開啟網址。"

msgid ""
"To handle clicked :bbcode:`[url]` tags, connect the ``RichTextLabel`` "
"node's :ref:`meta_clicked <class_RichTextLabel_signal_meta_clicked>` signal "
"to a script function."
msgstr ""
"若要處理 :bbcode:`[url]` 標籤的點選事件，請將 ``RichTextLabel`` 節點"
"的 :ref:`meta_clicked <class_RichTextLabel_signal_meta_clicked>` 訊號連接至腳"
"本函式。"

msgid ""
"For example, the following method can be connected to ``meta_clicked`` to "
"open clicked URLs using the user's default web browser:"
msgstr ""
"例如，以下方法可連接到 ``meta_clicked``，用來開啟被點擊的 URL（用使用者的預設"
"瀏覽器）："

msgid ""
"For more advanced use cases, it's also possible to store JSON in "
"a :bbcode:`[url]` tag's option and parse it in the function that handles the "
"``meta_clicked`` signal. For example:"
msgstr ""
"在進階用法中，也可以將 JSON 存入 :bbcode:`[url]` 標籤的選項，並在處理 "
"``meta_clicked`` 訊號的函式中解析。例如："

msgid "Horizontal rule options"
msgstr "水平分隔線選項"

msgid "Color name or color in HEX format"
msgstr "顏色名稱或 HEX 格式"

msgid "``Color(1, 1, 1, 1)``"
msgstr "``Color(1, 1, 1, 1)``"

msgid "Color tint of the rule (modulation)."
msgstr "分隔線的色彩調整（調變）。"

msgid "**height**"
msgstr "**height**"

msgid "Integer number"
msgstr "整數"

msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

msgid ""
"Target height of the rule in pixels, add ``%`` to the end of value to "
"specify it as percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"以像素為單位設定分隔線目標高度；若在數值後加上 ``%``，則會改以控制項寬度的百"
"分比指定。"

msgid "**width**"
msgstr "**width**"

msgid "``90%``"
msgstr "``90%``"

msgid ""
"Target width of the rule in pixels, add ``%`` to the end of value to specify "
"it as percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"以像素為單位設定分隔線目標寬度；若在數值後加上 ``%``，則會改以控制項寬度的百"
"分比指定。"

msgid "``left`` (or ``l``), ``center`` (or ``c``), ``right`` (or ``r``)"
msgstr "``left`` (或 ``l``), ``center`` (或 ``c``), ``right`` (或 ``r``)"

msgid "``center``"
msgstr "``center``"

msgid "Horizontal alignment."
msgstr "水平對齊。"

msgid "URL options"
msgstr "URL 選項"

msgid "**underline**"
msgstr "**underline**"

msgid "``always``, ``never``, ``hover``"
msgstr "``always``, ``never``, ``hover``"

msgid "``always``"
msgstr "``always``"

msgid "URL underlining mode."
msgstr "URL 底線模式。"

msgid "**tooltip**"
msgstr "**tooltip**"

msgid "String."
msgstr "字串。"

msgid "URL tooltip."
msgstr "URL 工具提示。"

msgid "**href**"
msgstr "**href**"

msgid "URL target address."
msgstr "URL 目標位址。"

msgid "Image options"
msgstr "圖片選項"

msgid "Color tint of the image (modulation)."
msgstr "圖片的色彩調整（調變）。"

msgid "Floating-point number"
msgstr "浮點數"

msgid "Target height of the image in pixels."
msgstr "影像的目標高度，單位是像素。"

msgid "Alternative units to pixels can be specified:"
msgstr "也可以指定像素以外的其他單位："

msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of the value to specify it as a percentage of the "
"control width instead of pixels. For example, ``height=50%`` will make the "
"image half as tall as the control is wide."
msgstr ""
"在值的末尾新增 ``%``，將其指定為控制項寬度的百分比，而不是像素。例如，"
"``height=50%`` 會使影像的高度變為控制項寬度的一半。"

msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of the value to specify it as a ratio of the "
"surrounding font size instead of pixels. For example, ``height=1em`` will "
"make the image as tall as the surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"在數值的末尾加上 ``em`` ，就可以把它指定為相對於周圍字型大小的比例，而不是固"
"定的像素。舉個例子，如果你設定 ``height=1em`` ，那麼這張圖片的高度就會變得和"
"周圍的文字一模一樣高。"

msgid "Target width of the image in pixels."
msgstr "影像的目標寬度（以像素為單位）。"

msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of the value to specify it as a percentage of the "
"control width instead of pixels. For example, ``width=50%`` will make the "
"image take up half of the control width."
msgstr ""
"在值的末尾新增 ``%``，將其指定為控制項寬度的百分比，而不是像素。例如，"
"``width=50%`` 會使影像佔據控制項寬度的一半。"

msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of the value to specify it as a ratio of the "
"surrounding font size instead of pixels. For example, ``width=1em`` will "
"make the image as wide as the surrounding text is tall."
msgstr ""
"在數值的末尾加上 ``em`` ，就可以把它指定為相對於周圍字型大小的比例，而不是固"
"定的像素。舉個例子，如果你設定 ``width=1em`` ，那麼這張圖片的寬度就會變得和周"
"圍文字的高度一模一樣。"

msgid "**region**"
msgstr "**region**"

msgid "x,y,width,height in pixels"
msgstr "x, y, 寬度, 高度（像素）"

msgid ""
"Region rect of the image. This can be used to display a single image from a "
"spritesheet."
msgstr "圖片的區域矩形。可用來從貼圖集（spritesheet）擷取單張圖片顯示。"

msgid "**pad**"
msgstr "**pad**"

msgid "``false``, ``true``"
msgstr "``false``、``true``"

msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

msgid ""
"If set to ``true``, and the image is smaller than the size specified by "
"``width`` and ``height``, the image padding is added to match the size "
"instead of upscaling."
msgstr ""
"若設為 ``true``，且圖片小於指定的 ``width`` 和 ``height``，則會加上邊距填滿，"
"而不是放大圖片。"

msgid "String"
msgstr "字串"

msgid "Image tooltip."
msgstr "圖片的工具提示。"

msgid "see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`"
msgstr "見 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`"

msgid "``center,center``"
msgstr "``center,center``"

msgid "Image alignment to the surrounding text."
msgstr "影像相對於周圍文字的對齊方式。"

msgid "**alt**"
msgstr "**alt**"

msgid "Image description for assistive apps (screen reader)."
msgstr "供輔助應用（螢幕閱讀器）使用的影像描述。"

msgid "Image and table vertical alignment"
msgstr "圖片與表格的垂直對齊"

msgid ""
"When a vertical alignment value is provided with the :bbcode:`[img]` "
"or :bbcode:`[table]` tag the image/table will try to align itself against "
"the surrounding text. Alignment is performed using a vertical point of the "
"image and a vertical point of the text. There are 3 possible points on the "
"image (``top``, ``center``, and ``bottom``) and 4 possible points on the "
"text and table (``top``, ``center``, ``baseline``, and ``bottom``), which "
"can be used in any combination."
msgstr ""
"為 :bbcode:`[img]` 或 :bbcode:`[table]` 標籤指定垂直對齊值時，圖片或表格會嘗"
"試與周圍文字對齊。對齊方式是比較圖片和文字各自的一個垂直基準點。圖片有 3 種可"
"用點（``top``、``center``、``bottom``），文字和表格有 4 種（``top``、"
"``center``、``baseline``、``bottom``），可任意組合。"

msgid ""
"To specify both points, use their full or short names as a value of the "
"image/table tag:"
msgstr "若要同時指定兩個對齊點，請在標籤中用完整或縮寫名稱設值："

msgid ""
"You can also specify just one value (``top``, ``center``, or ``bottom``) to "
"make use of a corresponding preset (``top-top``, ``center-center``, and "
"``bottom-bottom`` respectively)."
msgstr ""
"你也可以只填一個值（``top``、``center`` 或 ``bottom``），則會自動用預設組合"
"（分別是 ``top-top``、``center-center``、``bottom-bottom``）。"

msgid ""
"Short names for the values are ``t`` (``top``), ``c`` (``center``), ``l`` "
"(``baseline``), and ``b`` (``bottom``)."
msgstr ""
"縮寫為 ``t`` (``top``), ``c`` (``center``), ``l`` (``baseline``), and ``b`` "
"(``bottom``)."

msgid "Font options"
msgstr "字型選項"

msgid "**name**, **n**"
msgstr "**name**、**n**"

msgid "A valid Font resource path."
msgstr "有效的字型資源路徑。"

msgid "Font resource path."
msgstr "字型資源路徑。"

msgid "**size**, **s**"
msgstr "**size**、**s**"

msgid "Number in pixels."
msgstr "像素數值。"

msgid "Custom font size."
msgstr "自訂字型大小。"

msgid "**glyph_spacing**, **gl**"
msgstr "**glyph_spacing**、**gl**"

msgid "Extra spacing for each glyph."
msgstr "每個字元的額外間距。"

msgid "**space_spacing**, **sp**"
msgstr "**space_spacing**、**sp**"

msgid "Extra spacing for the space character."
msgstr "空白字元的額外間距。"

msgid "**top_spacing**, **top**"
msgstr "**top_spacing**、**top**"

msgid "Extra spacing at the top of the line."
msgstr "行頂端的額外間距。"

msgid "**bottom_spacing**, **bt**"
msgstr "**bottom_spacing**、**bt**"

msgid "Extra spacing at the bottom of the line."
msgstr "行底端的額外間距。"

msgid "**embolden**, **emb**"
msgstr "**embolden**、**emb**"

msgid "Floating-point number."
msgstr "浮點數。"

msgid "``0.0``"
msgstr "``0.0``"

msgid ""
"Font embolden strength, if it is not equal to zero, emboldens the font "
"outlines. Negative values reduce the outline thickness."
msgstr "字型加粗強度，非零時會加粗字型外框，負值則減少外框寬度。"

msgid "**face_index**, **fi**"
msgstr "**face_index**、**fi**"

msgid "Integer number."
msgstr "整數。"

msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

msgid "An active face index in the TrueType / OpenType collection."
msgstr "TrueType / OpenType 字型集合的作用中字型索引。"

msgid "**slant**, **sln**"
msgstr "**slant**、**sln**"

msgid ""
"Font slant strength, positive values slant glyphs to the right. Negative "
"values to the left."
msgstr "字型斜體傾斜強度，正值向右，負值向左。"

msgid "**opentype_variation**, **otv**"
msgstr "**opentype_variation**、**otv**"

msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the OpenType variation tags (no space after each "
"comma)."
msgstr "以逗號分隔的 OpenType 變化標籤清單（每個逗號後不得有空白）。"

msgid ""
"Font OpenType variation coordinates. See `OpenType variation tags <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg>`__."
msgstr ""
"字型 OpenType 變異座標。詳見 `OpenType variation tags <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg>`__。"

msgid ""
"Note: The value should be enclosed in ``\"`` to allow using ``=`` inside it:"
msgstr "注意：值需加上 ``\"``，才能在其中使用 ``=``："

msgid "**opentype_features**, **otf**"
msgstr "**opentype_features**、**otf**"

msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the OpenType feature tags (no space after each "
"comma)."
msgstr "以逗號分隔的 OpenType 功能標籤清單（每個逗號後不得有空白）。"

msgid ""
"Font OpenType features. See `OpenType features tags <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags>`__."
msgstr ""
"字型 OpenType 功能。詳見 `OpenType features tags <https://docs.microsoft.com/"
"en-us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags>`__。"

msgid "Named colors"
msgstr "命名顏色"

msgid ""
"For tags that allow specifying a color by name, you can use names of the "
"constants from the built-in :ref:`class_Color` class. Named colors can be "
"specified in a number of styles using different casings: ``DARK_RED``, "
"``DarkRed``, and ``darkred`` will give the same exact result."
msgstr ""
"對於支援通過名稱指定顏色的標籤，您可以使用內建 :ref:`class_Color` 類中的常數"
"名稱；命名顏色可通過多種樣式以不同的大小寫形式指定： ``DARK_RED`` 、 "
"``DarkRed`` 和 ``darkred`` 均會產生完全相同的結果。"

msgid "See this image for a list of color constants:"
msgstr "完整顏色常數請參考下圖："

msgid ""
"`View at full size <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/"
"master/img/color_constants.png>`__"
msgstr ""
"`檢視原尺寸 <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"img/color_constants.png>`__"

msgid "Hexadecimal color codes"
msgstr "十六進位顏色代碼"

msgid ""
"For opaque RGB colors, any valid 6-digit hexadecimal code is supported, "
"e.g. :bbcode:`[color=#ffffff]white[/color]`. Shorthand RGB color codes such "
"as ``#6f2`` (equivalent to ``#66ff22``) are also supported."
msgstr ""
"對於不透明 RGB 顏色，支援任何有效的 6 位十六進位色碼，例"
"如 :bbcode:`[color=#ffffff]white[/color]`。也支援 ``#6f2``（相當於 "
"``#66ff22``）這種簡寫 RGB 色碼。"

msgid ""
"For transparent RGB colors, any RGBA 8-digit hexadecimal code can be used, "
"e.g. :bbcode:`[color=#ffffff88]translucent white[/color]`. Note that the "
"alpha channel is the **last** component of the color code, not the first "
"one. Short RGBA color codes such as ``#6f28`` (equivalent to ``#66ff2288``) "
"are supported as well."
msgstr ""
"對於透明 RGB 顏色，可使用任何 8 位十六進位 RGBA 色碼，例"
"如 :bbcode:`[color=#ffffff88]translucent white[/color]`。請注意，Alpha 通道位"
"於色碼的 **最後**，而非最前面。也支援 ``#6f28``（相當於 ``#66ff2288``）這種簡"
"寫 RGBA 色碼。"

msgid "Cell options"
msgstr "儲存格選項"

msgid "**shrink**"
msgstr "**shrink**"

msgid "``true``"
msgstr "``true``"

msgid "If ``true``, cell can shrink to its contents."
msgstr "若為 ``true``，單元格可收縮至其內容大小。"

msgid "**expand**"
msgstr "**expand**"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid ""
"Cell expansion ratio. This defines which cells will try to expand to "
"proportionally to other cells and their expansion ratios."
msgstr "儲存格擴展比例。設定會依比例自動分配寬度。"

msgid "**border**"
msgstr "**border**"

msgid "Cell border color."
msgstr "儲存格邊框顏色。"

msgid "**bg**"
msgstr "**bg**"

msgid ""
"Cell background color. For alternating odd/even row backgrounds, you can use "
"``bg=odd_color,even_color``."
msgstr "儲存格背景顏色。如要指定奇數/偶數行不同顏色，可用 ``bg=奇色,偶色``。"

msgid "**padding**"
msgstr "**padding**"

msgid "4 comma-separated floating-point numbers (no space after each comma)"
msgstr "4 個以逗號分隔的浮點數（每個逗號後不得有空白）"

msgid "``0,0,0,0``"
msgstr "``0,0,0,0``"

msgid "Left, top, right, and bottom cell padding."
msgstr "儲存格內邊距（左、上、右、下）。"

msgid "Unordered list bullet"
msgstr "無序列表符號"

msgid ""
"By default, the :bbcode:`[ul]` tag uses the ``U+2022`` \"Bullet\" Unicode "
"glyph as the bullet character. This behavior is similar to web browsers. The "
"bullet character can be customized using :bbcode:`[ul bullet={bullet}]`. If "
"provided, this ``{bullet}`` parameter must be a string with no enclosing "
"quotes (for example, :bbcode:`[bullet=*]`). You can add trailing spaces "
"after the bullet character to increase the spacing between the bullet and "
"the list item text."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，:bbcode:`[ul]` 標籤使用 Unicode 字元 ``U+2022``「Bullet」作為項目"
"符號，行為與網頁瀏覽器類似。可以使用 :bbcode:`[ul bullet={bullet}]` 自訂項目"
"符號。若提供 ``{bullet}`` 參數，必須是沒有外層引號的字串（例"
"如 :bbcode:`[bullet=*]`）。你可以在項目符號後加上空白，增加符號與清單項目文字"
"之間的間距。"

msgid ""
"See `Bullet (typography) on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bullet_(typography)>`__ for a list of common bullet characters that you can "
"paste directly in the ``bullet`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"常見符號可參考維基百科：`Bullet (typography) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bullet_(typography)>`__，直接貼到 ``bullet`` 參數即可。"

msgid "Ordered list types"
msgstr "有序列表型別"

msgid ""
"Ordered lists can be used to automatically mark items with numbers or "
"letters in ascending order. This tag supports the following type options:"
msgstr "有序列表可自動用數字或字母遞增標記條目。支援下列型別："

msgid "``1`` - Numbers, using language specific numbering system if possible."
msgstr "``1`` - 數字，若可則依語言調整數字格式。"

msgid "``a``, ``A`` - Lower and upper case Latin letters."
msgstr "``a``、``A`` - 小寫或大寫拉丁字母。"

msgid "``i``, ``I`` - Lower and upper case Roman numerals."
msgstr "``i``、``I`` - 小寫或大寫羅馬數字。"

msgid "Text effects"
msgstr "文字特效"

msgid ""
"BBCode can also be used to create different text effects that can optionally "
"be animated. Several customizable effects are provided out of the box, and "
"you can easily create your own. By default, animated effects will "
"pause :ref:`when the SceneTree is paused <doc_pausing_games>`. You can "
"change this behavior by adjusting the RichTextLabel's **Process > Mode** "
"property."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 還可以用來建立各種不同的文字特效，並且你可以選擇是否讓這些特效帶有動"
"畫。Godot 引擎開箱即用地提供了好幾種可以自訂的特效，而且你也可以非常輕鬆地建"
"立屬於你自己的特效。預設情況下， :ref:`when the SceneTree is paused "
"<doc_pausing_games>` ，帶有動畫的特效也會跟著暫停。你可以通過調整 "
"RichTextLabel 節點的 **Process > Mode** （處理 > 模式） 屬性來改變這一行為。"

msgid ""
"All examples below mention the default values for options in the listed tag "
"format."
msgstr "以下範例都會列出標籤格式的預設選項值。"

msgid ""
"Text effects that move characters' positions may result in characters being "
"clipped by the RichTextLabel node bounds."
msgstr "會移動字元位置的文字特效可能導致字元被 RichTextLabel 節點的邊界裁切。"

msgid ""
"You can resolve this by disabling **Control > Layout > Clip Contents** in "
"the inspector after selecting the RichTextLabel node, or ensuring there is "
"enough margin added around the text by using line breaks above and below the "
"line using the effect."
msgstr ""
"可在屬性檢視器將 RichTextLabel 的 **Control > Layout > Clip Contents** 關閉，"
"或在特效文字上下行加空行，避免被裁切。"

msgid "Pulse"
msgstr "脈衝"

msgid ""
"Pulse creates an animated pulsing effect that multiplies each character's "
"opacity and color. It can be used to bring attention to specific text. Its "
"tag format is :bbcode:`[pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40 ease=-2.0]{text}[/"
"pulse]`."
msgstr ""
"Pulse 會產生脈衝動畫效果，逐字元調整不透明度與顏色，適合強調特定文字。標籤格"
"式為 :bbcode:`[pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40 ease=-2.0]{text}[/pulse]`。"

msgid ""
"``freq`` controls the frequency of the half-pulsing cycle (higher is "
"faster). A full pulsing cycle takes ``2 * (1.0 / freq)`` seconds. ``color`` "
"is the target color multiplier for blinking. The default mostly fades out "
"text, but not entirely. ``ease`` is the easing function exponent to use. "
"Negative values provide in-out easing, which is why the default is ``-2.0``."
msgstr ""
"``freq`` 控制半波脈衝的頻率（越高越快），完整週期為 ``2 * (1.0 / freq)`` 秒。"
"``color`` 是閃爍時的目標色彩倍增值。預設會讓文字大多淡出但不完全消失。"
"``ease`` 為緩動指數，負值為 in-out 緩動，因此預設為 ``-2.0``。"

msgid "Wave"
msgstr "波浪"

msgid ""
"Wave makes the text go up and down. Its tag format is :bbcode:`[wave "
"amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=1]{text}[/wave]`."
msgstr ""
"Wave 讓文字上下起伏。標籤格式為 :bbcode:`[wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=1]"
"{text}[/wave]`。"

msgid ""
"``amp`` controls how high and low the effect goes, and ``freq`` controls how "
"fast the text goes up and down. A ``freq`` value of ``0`` will result in no "
"visible waves, and negative ``freq`` values won't display any waves either. "
"If ``connected`` is ``1`` (default), glyphs with ligatures will be moved "
"together. If ``connected`` is ``0``, each glyph is moved individually even "
"if they are joined by ligatures. This can work around certain rendering "
"issues with font ligatures."
msgstr ""
"``amp`` 控制波幅，``freq`` 控制上下擺動速度。``freq`` 為 0 或負值都不會顯示波"
"動。``connected`` 設為 ``1``（預設）時，連字會一起移動；為 ``0`` 時即使有連字"
"也各自獨立，這可解決某些字型連字的顯示問題。"

msgid "Tornado"
msgstr "龍捲風"

msgid ""
"Tornado makes the text move around in a circle. Its tag format "
"is :bbcode:`[tornado radius=10.0 freq=1.0 connected=1]{text}[/tornado]`."
msgstr ""
"Tornado 讓文字沿圓形路徑移動。標籤格式為 :bbcode:`[tornado radius=10.0 "
"freq=1.0 connected=1]{text}[/tornado]`。"

msgid ""
"``radius`` is the radius of the circle that controls the offset, ``freq`` is "
"how fast the text moves in a circle. A ``freq`` value of ``0`` will pause "
"the animation, while negative ``freq`` will play the animation backwards. If "
"``connected`` is ``1`` (default), glyphs with ligatures will be moved "
"together. If ``connected`` is ``0``, each glyph is moved individually even "
"if they are joined by ligatures. This can work around certain rendering "
"issues with font ligatures."
msgstr ""
"``radius`` 控制圓的半徑（偏移量），``freq`` 是環繞速度。``freq`` 為 0 會暫停"
"動畫，負值則反向播放。``connected`` 同上，設為 1 連字一起動，設為 0 各自動。"

msgid "Shake"
msgstr "抖動"

msgid ""
"Shake makes the text shake. Its tag format is :bbcode:`[shake rate=20.0 "
"level=5 connected=1]{text}[/shake]`."
msgstr ""
"Shake 讓文字震動。標籤格式為 :bbcode:`[shake rate=20.0 level=5 connected=1]"
"{text}[/shake]`。"

msgid ""
"``rate`` controls how fast the text shakes, ``level`` controls how far the "
"text is offset from the origin. If ``connected`` is ``1`` (default), glyphs "
"with ligatures will be moved together. If ``connected`` is ``0``, each glyph "
"is moved individually even if they are joined by ligatures. This can work "
"around certain rendering issues with font ligatures."
msgstr ""
"``rate`` 控制抖動速度，``level`` 控制偏移幅度。``connected`` 同上，設為 1 連"
"字一起動，0 則各自動，可避免連字顯示問題。"

msgid "Fade"
msgstr "漸隱"

msgid ""
"Fade creates a static fade effect that multiplies each character's opacity. "
"Its tag format is :bbcode:`[fade start=4 length=14]{text}[/fade]`."
msgstr ""
"Fade 產生靜態淡出效果，逐字元調整不透明度。標籤格式為 :bbcode:`[fade start=4 "
"length=14]{text}[/fade]`。"

msgid ""
"``start`` controls the starting position of the falloff relative to where "
"the fade command is inserted, ``length`` controls over how many characters "
"should the fade out take place."
msgstr "``start`` 控制從哪個字元開始淡出，``length`` 控制淡出影響的字元數。"

msgid "Rainbow"
msgstr "彩虹"

msgid ""
"Rainbow gives the text a rainbow color that changes over time. Its tag "
"format is :bbcode:`[rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]{text}[/"
"rainbow]`."
msgstr ""
"Rainbow 讓文字呈現隨時間變化的彩虹色。標籤格式為 :bbcode:`[rainbow freq=1.0 "
"sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]{text}[/rainbow]`。"

msgid ""
"``freq`` determines how many letters the rainbow extends over before it "
"repeats itself, ``sat`` is the saturation of the rainbow, ``val`` is the "
"value of the rainbow. ``speed`` is the number of full rainbow cycles per "
"second. A positive ``speed`` value will play the animation forwards, a value "
"of ``0`` will pause the animation, and a negative ``speed`` value will play "
"the animation backwards."
msgstr ""
"``freq`` 控制彩虹色變化週期內包含的字數，``sat`` 是飽和度，``val`` 是明度，"
"``speed`` 是每秒循環次數。正值正向動畫，0 停止，負值則反向。"

msgid ""
"Font outlines are *not* affected by the rainbow effect (they keep their "
"original color). Existing font colors are overridden by the rainbow effect. "
"However, CanvasItem's **Modulate** and **Self Modulate** properties will "
"affect how the rainbow effect looks, as modulation multiplies its final "
"colors."
msgstr ""
"字型外框 **不受** 彩虹特效影響（維持原色），現有字型顏色會被覆蓋。但 "
"CanvasItem 的 **Modulate** 和 **Self Modulate** 屬性會影響最終彩虹色，因為調"
"變會套在最後顏色上。"

msgid "Custom BBCode tags and text effects"
msgstr "自訂 BBCode 標籤與文字特效"

msgid ""
"You can extend the :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` resource type to create your "
"own custom BBCode tags. Create a new script file that extends "
"the :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` resource type and give the script a "
"``class_name`` so that the effect can be selected in the inspector. Add the "
"``@tool`` annotation to your GDScript file if you wish to have these custom "
"effects run within the editor itself. The RichTextLabel does not need to "
"have a script attached, nor does it need to be running in ``tool`` mode. The "
"new effect can be registered in the Inspector by adding it to the **Markup > "
"Custom Effects** array, or in code with the :ref:`install_effect() "
"<class_RichTextLabel_method_install_effect>` method:"
msgstr ""
"你可以擴充 :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` 資源類型來建立自訂 BBCode 標籤。建立一"
"個繼承 :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` 的腳本，並設定 ``class_name`` 以便在屬性檢"
"視器選用。若想在編輯器中執行這些特效，請在 GDScript 標頭加 ``@tool``。"
"RichTextLabel 本身不需掛腳本，也不必進入 ``tool`` 模式。新效果可於屬性檢視器"
"的 **Markup > Custom Effects** 陣列新增，或用 :ref:`install_effect() "
"<class_RichTextLabel_method_install_effect>` 方法程式註冊："

msgid ""
"Selecting a custom RichTextEffect after saving a script that extends "
"RichTextEffect with a ``class_name``"
msgstr ""
"儲存有 ``class_name`` 的 RichTextEffect 腳本後，可於屬性檢視器選擇自訂特效"

msgid ""
"If the custom effect is not registered within the RichTextLabel's **Markup > "
"Custom Effects** property, no effect will be visible and the original tag "
"will be left as-is."
msgstr ""
"若自訂效果未在 RichTextLabel 的 **Markup > Custom Effects** 屬性註冊，則不會"
"顯示特效，原標籤會原樣顯示。"

msgid ""
"There is only one function that you need to extend: "
"``_process_custom_fx(char_fx)``. Optionally, you can also provide a custom "
"BBCode identifier by adding a member name ``bbcode``. The code will check "
"the ``bbcode`` property automatically or will use the name of the file to "
"determine what the BBCode tag should be."
msgstr ""
"你只需實作一個函式：``_process_custom_fx(char_fx)``。也可以額外設定 "
"``bbcode`` 成員，自訂 BBCode 名稱。Godot 會自動讀取這個屬性，否則就用檔案名稱"
"當作標籤名。"

msgid "``_process_custom_fx``"
msgstr "``_process_custom_fx``"

msgid ""
"This is where the logic of each effect takes place and is called once per "
"glyph during the draw phase of text rendering. This passes in "
"a :ref:`class_CharFXTransform` object, which holds a few variables to "
"control how the associated glyph is rendered:"
msgstr ""
"這是每個特效的運作邏輯所在，於文字算繪的繪製階段，每個字元（glyph）都會呼叫一"
"次。該函式會收到一個 :ref:`class_CharFXTransform` 物件，內含多個變數可用來控"
"制字元的顯示方式："

msgid "``outline`` is ``true`` if effect is called for drawing text outline."
msgstr "``outline`` 若為 ``true``，代表目前在繪製文字外框時呼叫特效。"

msgid ""
"``range`` tells you how far into a given custom effect block you are in as "
"an index."
msgstr "``range`` 會告知你在自訂特效區塊內的索引位置。"

msgid ""
"``elapsed_time`` is the total amount of time the text effect has been "
"running."
msgstr "``elapsed_time`` 是特效運作到目前為止的總秒數。"

msgid ""
"``visible`` will tell you whether the glyph is visible or not and will also "
"allow you to hide a given portion of text."
msgstr "``visible`` 表示該字元是否顯示，也可用來隱藏部分文字。"

msgid ""
"``offset`` is an offset position relative to where the given glyph should "
"render under normal circumstances."
msgstr "``offset`` 是相對於原本字元顯示位置的偏移量。"

msgid "``color`` is the color of a given glyph."
msgstr "``color`` 是當前字元的顏色。"

msgid ""
"``glyph_index`` and ``font`` is glyph being drawn and font data resource "
"used to draw it."
msgstr ""
"``glyph_index`` 及 ``font`` 分別是目前要繪製的字元索引及使用的字型資源。"

msgid ""
"Finally, ``env`` is a :ref:`class_Dictionary` of parameters assigned to a "
"given custom effect. You can use :ref:`get() <class_Dictionary_method_get>` "
"with an optional default value to retrieve each parameter, if specified by "
"the user. For example :bbcode:`[custom_fx spread=0.5 color=#FFFF00]test[/"
"custom_fx]` would have a float ``spread`` and Color ``color`` parameters in "
"its ``env`` Dictionary. See below for more usage examples."
msgstr ""
"最後，``env`` 是指派給某個自訂效果參數的 :ref:`class_Dictionary`。你可以使"
"用 :ref:`get() <class_Dictionary_method_get>`（可選擇提供預設值）取得使用者指"
"定的各個參數。例如 :bbcode:`[custom_fx spread=0.5 color=#FFFF00]test[/"
"custom_fx]` 的 ``env`` 字典中，會有 float 型別的 ``spread`` 與 Color 型別的 "
"``color`` 參數。更多用法請見下方範例。"

msgid ""
"The last thing to note about this function is that it is necessary to return "
"a boolean ``true`` value to verify that the effect processed correctly. This "
"way, if there's a problem with rendering a given glyph, it will back out of "
"rendering custom effects entirely until the user fixes whatever error "
"cropped up in their custom effect logic."
msgstr ""
"最後注意：這個函式必須回傳布林值 ``true``，表示特效處理成功。若回傳 "
"``false``，Godot 會停止渲染自訂特效，直到你修正造成錯誤的邏輯。"

msgid "Here are some examples of custom effects:"
msgstr "以下是自訂特效的範例："

msgid "Ghost"
msgstr "幽靈"

msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "數字雨（Matrix）"

msgid "This will add a few new BBCode commands, which can be used like so:"
msgstr "這樣會新增幾個 BBCode 指令，可這樣使用："
